<title>BELGIUM: Ericsson EU assembly deal worth 5.4 mln Ecus.</title>
<headline>Ericsson EU assembly deal worth 5.4 mln Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ericsson said on Tuesday a contract it had signed with the European Parliament was worth 5.4 million European currency units ($6.8 million).</p>
<p>The company said previously that it had an agreement with the Parliament to install 20,000 Consono MD110 lines in the cities of Brussels, Strasbourg and Luxembourg. -- Brussels newsroom: +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
